Here's the scoop on the old hack :

The amulet is on the (only) maze level in the game - around the 20th level.  It
is nearly always hidden under a boulder, so have a pickaxe (to smash the
boulder) or a wand of digging (to knock out walls so that you can push around
the boulders).

I don't think a wished for AoY counts for winning.

There is no endlevel, you just have to escape the dungeon.

